OL,3,GNEWSACity leaders push for affordable
OL,4,Ahomes cash boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo of York's most senior politicians
OL,7,Fhave said they are pushing the
OL,8,Fgovernment for more money for
OL,9,Faffordable housing as part of a major
OL,10,Fregeneration scheme in the city.
OL,12,FLabour Mayor of York and North
OL,13,FYorkshire David Skaith said he was
OL,14,F"determined" to see a doubling of
OL,15,Faffordable homes - from 20% to 40% - at
OL,16,Fthe #2bn York Central site.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
