OL,3,GNEWSACity leaders push for affordable
OL,4,Ahomes cash boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FClare Douglas, City of York Council's
OL,7,FLabour leader, said while the planning
OL,8,Fpermission required that a minimum 20%
OL,9,Fof those homes were considered
OL,10,Faffordable, "we have important
OL,11,Fambitions to go further".
OL,13,FThe BBC understands that Homes England
OL,14,Fis working with other York Central
OL,15,Fstakeholders to look into options that
OL,16,Fwould see more affordable homes at the
OL,17,Fsite.
